\p{\code{\verb~|rene~}, the package manager: Nickel manifests, path dependencies with pubgrub version solving, cross-package builds with a process pool (\code{\verb~|-j~}), profiles, machine targets (\code{\verb~|--target~}), product selection (\code{\verb~|--bin~}/\code{\verb~|--lib~}), freshness tracking, and JSON introspection (\code{\verb~|rene inspect~}).}

\p{Landed in \pr{486}.}
